  <summary>Kopuz, built every night from the latest development code</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Kopuz Nightly is the music player Kopuz, built from its newest development code each night.
      It keeps its own library, settings and sign-ins apart from Kopuz, so both can be installed together.
      On first start it copies Kopuz's library if there is one.
    </p>
    <p>
      Expect rough edges: a nightly gets new features first, and their bugs with them.
    </p>
  </description>
